  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Animal Health in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project  interventions will support the Government of Ukraine&apos;s capacity to assist rural poultry and livestock holders with essential animal health services. Production of poultry and livestock also requires inputs such as mineral supplements and veterinary medicines which vulnerable rural farming households and small-scale farms participating in the project will be able to access through a value voucher. This assistance is intended to safeguard livestock assets and support livelihoods in this sector. Delivery of veterinary supplies will be directly to government facilities at oblast level.</narrative>
  </description>
